      "created_at": "2012-08-22T18:37:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For the last Kickstarter, I got an email notification with a tracking number, which I obsessed over for a full week before receiving my package.&nbsp; Maddeningly, I could see that my package had been received at the St. Louis shipping center and then sat there for days and days while they held it to make sure it didn't arrive to me earlier than they'd promised. :(</p><p>I think you've asked the question is exactly the right place.</p>",
